message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "SAR Flood Mapping in Hanoi — Pipeline Code"
abstract: >
  Multi-temporal Sentinel-1 SAR flood segmentation pipeline for Hanoi, Vietnam,
  with external validation against CEMS and the JRC Global Flood Monitoring
  product, deep-ensemble uncertainty quantification, and OpenStreetMap-based
  infrastructure exposure assessment.
